import { media } from "../../lib/media";
---

<section class="on-paper angled angled-gold">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="about-copy rv">
      <blockquote class="mission">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p>
        <p>Serve as the Los Alamitos hub for hands-on engineering and business experience for all ages through student-led, student-driven competition in FRC.</p>
      </blockquote>
      <p>Los Al Robotics is Los Alamitos High School's <i>FIRST</i> Robotics Competition team, also known as The Golden Griffins, Team 6220. This season 48 students, from 8th to 12th grade, design, build, program, and fund a 115-pound competition robot. They also run the team itself: the budget, the sponsors, the schedule, and the training.</p>
      <p>We treat robotics like a varsity sport. Fall is training and offseason competitions. In January a new game is released and the build season starts, with meetings nearly every day for six weeks. In the spring we compete at FIRST California district events, against teams from across the state.</p>
      <p>Our mentors are engineers and professionals who bring experience, safety, and advice. The students make the decisions.</p>
      <div class="frc-note">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">What is FRC?</p>
        <p>The <i>FIRST</i> Robotics Competition is an international high school league. Each January a new game is revealed, and teams have a few months to design and build a robot to play it. Teams compete hard, then help each other in the pits.</p>
        <a class="sweep" href="https://www.firstinspires.org/robotics/frc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more at <i>FIRST</i> ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="has-dots rv" style="--d:1"><svg class="deco dots dots-about" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#dotk)"/></svg><figure class="photo-frame photo-card" style="margin:0"><div class="pc-in"><img src={media("team/2d048fe84f.webp")} alt="Team 6220 members in gold and black team shirts smiling up at the camera in the pits" loading="lazy"></div></figure></div>
  </div>
</section>
